{"id":73592,"date":"2026-11-09T15:25:58","date_gmt":"2026-11-09T15:25:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73592"},"modified":"2026-11-09T16:28:03","modified_gmt":"2026-11-09T15:28:03","slug":"cdm-beer-mile","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cdm-beer-mile\/","title":{"rendered":"CDM Beer Mile 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">CDM Beer Mile 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>CDM Beer Mile 2027<\/strong> chega a <strong>Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado, <strong>30 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, para um desafio desportivo e recreativo que combina velocidade, estrat\u00e9gia de transi\u00e7\u00e3o e conv\u00edvio. Com partida nas imedia\u00e7\u00f5es do <strong>Parque Verde da Cidade de Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong>, a prova prop\u00f5e a cl\u00e1ssica dist\u00e2ncia da milha (aproximadamente <strong>1.600 metros<\/strong>) intercalada por quatro paragens obrigat\u00f3rias para consumo de cerveja em \u00e1rea de transi\u00e7\u00e3o controlada por ju\u00edzes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao longo do tra\u00e7ado urbano junto ao <strong>Parque Verde da Cidade<\/strong>, banhado pelos rios Alcoa e Ba\u00e7a e a poucos minutos do hist\u00f3rico <strong>Mosteiro de Santa Maria de Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong> (Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO), os participantes partem distribu\u00eddos por <strong>10 boxes de at\u00e9 30 atletas<\/strong> a intervalos de 10 minutos a partir das <strong>11:30<\/strong>. Cada atleta disp\u00f5e de um tempo limite individual de <strong>15 minutos<\/strong> para cumprir os 1.600 metros e as quatro doses de 20 a 25 cl, apurando-se os <strong>30 melhores tempos masculinos e as 5 melhores atletas femininas<\/strong> para a grande final das <strong>15:30<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>CDM Running Crew<\/strong>, esta iniciativa exclusiva para maiores de 18 anos est\u00e1 limitada a <strong>300 vagas<\/strong> e conta com classifica\u00e7\u00e3o individual e por equipas (soma dos tr\u00eas melhores atletas na qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o), al\u00e9m de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio opcional com sopa da pedra e bifana entre as 13:00 e as 15:00.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">30 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque Verde da Cidade, Alcoba\u00e7a, Leiria<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Milha Cervejeira (1,6 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">CDM Running Crew<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Corte)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 minutos por s\u00e9rie<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/storage\/events\/cdm-beer-mile-2027\/regulamento_pt_1794078236.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">CDM Beer Mile \u2013 Fase de Qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (10 Boxes) (1,6 Km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral (Limite 300 vagas):<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Pagamento em 72h (+6.00 \u20ac c\/ almo\u00e7o opcional))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">CDM Beer Mile \u2013 Grande Final (Top 30 M \/ Top 5 F) (1,6 Km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:30<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rio de partida da CDM Beer Mile 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A CDM Beer Mile 2027 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 30 de janeiro de 2027, nas imedia\u00e7\u00f5es do Parque Verde da Cidade, em Alcoba\u00e7a. As 10 boxes de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o partem a intervalos de 10 minutos a partir das 11:30, e a Grande Final decorre \u00e0s 15:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o percurso de 1.600 metros e as regras de consumo?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova consiste numa volta de aproximadamente 1.600 metros com 4 pontos obrigat\u00f3rios de bebida (doses de 20 a 25 cl fornecidas pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o). O consumo \u00e9 feito na \u00e1rea de transi\u00e7\u00e3o sinalizada e o atleta deve virar o copo vazio perante o juiz antes de prosseguir. Sair sem confirmar o copo vazio ou entornar bebida acrescenta 1 minuto de penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o (vomitar antes da meta penaliza 2 minutos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o custo de 12,00 \u20ac (limitada a 300 vagas para maiores de 18 anos) e inclui seguro, t-shirt, dorsal, copo oficial do evento e brindes. Existe ainda a op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio por mais 6,00 \u20ac (sopa da pedra, bifana e bebida, servido entre as 13:00 e as 15:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e como funciona o apuramento para a final e equipas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Cada atleta tem um tempo limite individual de 15 minutos desde a partida da sua box. Os 30 homens e as 5 mulheres com melhores tempos v\u00e1lidos na qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o apuram-se para a final das 15:30. A Melhor Equipa \u00e9 apurada pela menor soma dos tempos dos tr\u00eas atletas mais r\u00e1pidos na qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a CDM Beer Mile 2027 e onde consultar os resultados?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela CDM Running Crew em Alcoba\u00e7a. Ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o da prova, todas as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o e da final poder\u00e3o ser consultadas no portal Portugal Running.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"CDM Beer Mile 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-30\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-30\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque Verde da Cidade, Alcoba\u00e7a\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alcoba\u00e7a\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A CDM Beer Mile 2027 realiza-se a 30 de janeiro no Parque Verde de Alcoba\u00e7a (1,6 km e 4 pontos de transi\u00e7\u00e3o). Consulta o regulamento oficial e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/beer-mile-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\"